# An unknown computed datetime part in `datetime_diff` is DS4004 when the query runs.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| project d = datetime_diff(strcat('fort', 'night'), timestamp, timestamp)
---- expected
error[DS4004]: `fortnight` is not a datetime part
  --> query:2:15
  |
2 | | project d = datetime_diff(strcat('fort', 'night'), timestamp, timestamp)
  |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ in this call of `datetime_diff`
  |
  = note: the parts are "year", "quarter", "month", "week_of_year", "week", "day", "dayofyear", "hour", "minute", "second", "millisecond", "microsecond", "nanosecond"
